mlxflow 0.8
1. Read Image       photo.jpg
2. Describe Image   Gemma 4 E4B Vision; "Describe this photo in three
                    sentences: who or what is in it, and the setting."
3. Draft            Gemma 4 E4B; "a gentle bedtime story for a young
                    child, about 120 words, set in this scene. Plain text
                    only, no title."
4. Speak            Kokoro 82M; af_heart; seed=7
5. Save Audio       story.wav

models:
  Gemma 4 E4B Vision = mlx-community/gemma-4-e4b-it-4bit
  Gemma 4 E4B        = mlx-community/gemma-4-e4b-it-4bit
